<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Control in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Control in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Control Instruments Group Ltd said on Thursday it was still in talks which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
